// Copyright (c) 2026 Roshan. All rights reserved.// Proprietary license — see LICENSE file for details.package com.roshan.persona.security.storage/** * NOUS — Migration result (Module 12, Pillar 4). * * Strategy §12.4 — sealed result of [SqlCipherMigrationManager.migrate]: * *   - **SUCCESS** — migration completed; the encrypted database is now active. *   - **FAILED** — migration could not complete (e.g., disk full, encryption *     key unavailable). The plain database is preserved unchanged; user can *     retry after freeing space / re-authenticating. *   - **NEEDS_RETRY** — migration was interrupted (e.g., app killed mid-copy). *     On next launch, [SqlCipherMigrationManager] will detect the partial *     state and resume from where it left off. */sealed interface MigrationResult {    /**     * Migration succeeded.     *     * @param rowsMigrated number of rows copied from the plain database.     * @param durationMs wall-clock duration of the migration.     */    data class Success(        val rowsMigrated: Long,        val durationMs: Long,    ) : MigrationResult    /**     * Migration failed.     *     * @param reason machine-readable reason code (e.g., "disk_full",     *   "encryption_key_unavailable", "integrity_check_failed").     * @param detail human-readable detail for logging.     */    data class Failed(        val reason: String,        val detail: String? = null,    ) : MigrationResult    /**     * Migration was interrupted — retry on next launch.     *     * @param stage which stage was interrupted (e.g., "copying_tables",     *   "verifying_integrity", "swapping_databases").     */    data class NeedsRetry(        val stage: String,    ) : MigrationResult}